      Proposed journey J03, addressing staff need ST03. Use an invented report of changed household circumstances to identify policy topics and operational evidence gaps.

      Acceptance: distinguish source-backed, stakeholder-derived and unresolved requirements. Record which authorised role must review operational requirements; do not infer a mandatory identity document or risk score from policy text.

