          of a household change with its event date.'
        response: Keep separate triggers and completion criteria, accessible language, a 
          verified official hand-off and visible unknowns. Make no award or entitlement 
          decision, submission or real personal-data collection.
        impact: Evaluation design only; not executed.
        escalation: User research, service and policy owners must validate both journeys 
